Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在几点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是外面还很黑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it's dark out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你老是睡到中午  傻瓜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, well, that's because you always sleep till noon, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,9点就是这么黑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is what 9 looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我该梳洗一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I'll get washed up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备看日出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Watch that sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再偷偷摸摸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really getting tired of sneaking around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我也是  不然我们  去外面度周末  就没人打扰我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, me too. Hey, Y'know what if we went away for the whole weekend? Y'know we'd have no interruptions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还可以赤身裸体整个周末\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we could be naked the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个周末  暴露个够\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All weekend? That's a whole lot of naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说去开会  你就说去参加厨师研讨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I could say I have a conference and you can say you have a chef thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想参加泽西州的烹饪大会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I've always wanted to go to this culinary fair in Jersey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  你去的不是那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha, okay. You know you're not, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  好  走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  乔伊怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. What about Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第05集  谁进谁出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E05  The One With All the Kips
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我这周末要干嘛吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guess what I'm doing this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去纽泽西参加烹饪大会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Going to this culinary fair in Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真巧  钱德刚才说  要去那里开会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How weird! Chandler just told us he's got a conference there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's funny
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德应该  去康州或佛蒙特州开会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seems like Chandler's conference could've been in Connecticut or Vermont.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不能决定在哪里开会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not in charge of where the conference is held.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你希望大家认为我造假  我可没说谎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want people to think it's a fake conference? It's a real conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋在吗  我要找她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is Rachel here? I gotta talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她出去逛街了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, she's out shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫艾蜜莉来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told Emily to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我得赶快跟瑞秋说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I just need to, you know, talk to Rachel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.50,0:02:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉来了之后  你真的就不见瑞秋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when Emily comes, you're just, you're not gonna see Rachel anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只能专心想着 "我可以见我老婆"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well look, I'm just trying to focus on the "I get to see my wife," part, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不去想我快胄溃疡的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And not the part that makes me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们  再也不能共处一室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, so you guys are, you're never gonna be in the same room together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How is that even gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我一定会想到办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But-but I assure you I will figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来实在不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It doesn't seem like it's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, guys. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正要帮摩妮卡翻床垫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're flipping Monica's mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为  应该先抬起来  再翻过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm thinking, basically, we pick it up, and then we flip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这方法比我的主意好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's better than my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不  你们顺便帮我翻好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, guys, would you flip mine too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈寄信来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look! A letter from my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Rach?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道艾蜜莉要来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how Emily's coming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听得到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  刚刚有人说  "听得到吗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, somebody just said, "Can you hear anything?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊的大屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得上次他们吵架分手时  我们卡在房里没东西可吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, remember when they got in that big fight and broke up and we were all stuck in her all night with no food or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯在婚礼上说出瑞秋名字后  我猜旧戏可能会重演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, when Ross said "Rachel" at the wedding, I figured it was gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我在这里藏了这些东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? So I hid this in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有糖果  猜谜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, candy bars, crossword puzzles...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有疯狂字谜   我要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, Mad Libs. Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保险套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Condoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道会在这里待多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you don't know how long we're gonna be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好我们还得负责  繁衍人类后代\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We may have to re-populate the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴保险套还想繁衍后代\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And condoms are the way to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个关键问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, it all boils down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:05:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次我跟艾蜜莉通电话  天啊  我的狗死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The last time I talked to Emily... Aah! Oh, my God! Our dog died!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  天啊  拉普死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Oh, my God. LaPooh, our dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉普还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}LaPooh's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈说他被冰淇淋车撞倒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! It says he was hit by an ice-cream truck
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还被拖了19条街\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and dragged for 19 blocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到你在哭  别哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sweetie, we heard you crying. Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是拉普\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's LaPooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你觉得满肚子大便  过几天就没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, it's LaPooh right now but it'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议  我们到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe it! We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,枕头上还放巧克力  我最爱这套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, chocolates on the pillows! Oh, I love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你应该跟乔伊住  到处都有巧克力糖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should live with Joey. Roll-os everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Okay, be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡快来看  电视正在播警匪公路追逐战\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, get in here. It's a high-speed car chase on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要换房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're switching rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他们给了我们玻璃杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, dear God, they gave us glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子上有口红印\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They gave us glasses with lipstick on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果连杯子都没换  谁知道还有哪些东西没换\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If they didn't change the glasses, who knows what else they didn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我只是希望  过个完美的周末\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on, sweetie. I just want this weekend to be perfect, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换个房间  好嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can change rooms, can't we? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  要换就快换  5号直升机刚跟丢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but let's do it now, though, because Chopper 5 just lost its feed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我上次有事想要告诉你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how there was something I wanted to talk to you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我很希望跟艾蜜莉合好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know I'm trying to work things out with Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there's this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我要说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我答应她了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I made a promise that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你流鼻血\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh hey! What? Your nose is bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你流血了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God! You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别又来了  我祖父去世时也一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Oh not again! This happened when my grandfather died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在是抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's... Ugh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, gross, unh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  对不起  你刚才要说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So I'm sorry. What did you wanna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再见你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't see you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.23,0:07:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  真是的  我也看不见你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I know, it's ridiculous. I can't see you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们可能会喜欢这间房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you'll find this room more to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说他只剩下一半的汽油了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They say he's only got half a tank left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一半  那还可以跑很久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Half a tank? We still got a lot of high-speed chasing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须换房间  什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're switching rooms again. What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这间房是花园景观  我们订的是海景房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a garden-view room and we paid for an ocean-view room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:08:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩一间海景房  可是你们不喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our last ocean-view room was unacceptable to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思   我可以跟你谈一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me. Um, can I talk to you over here for just a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些小人想占我们便宜  我才没那么蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, these clowns are trying to take us for a ride. I won't let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不是一对小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not a couple of suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得好  大姐头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hear you, Mugsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些房间都还好啊  请赶快选定  让我看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, look, all these rooms are fine.Okay? Can you just pick one so I can watch the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我跟你一起好好度假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have a perfect, magical weekend together with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这间  没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, this one I like. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没了  结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然没有延长时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it, this is regularly scheduled programming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以关掉电视吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we turn the TV off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道整个周末都要看电视\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do we really want to spend the entire weekend like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我是不是  妨碍你换房间了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, am I getting in the way of all the room-switching fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你发火可别怪到我身上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha, don't blame me for ruining tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则该怪谁  那个拖着行李  跑过10间房的倒霉服务生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who should I blame? The nice bellman who had to drag our luggage to 10 rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  或许该怪那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, how about the idiot who thought he could drive...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以为用半箱汽油  就可以从纽约跑到加拿大的家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...from Albany to Canada on a half a tank of gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要说死者的坏话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do not speak ill of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出来就是为了过个浪漫的周末\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're supposed to be spending a romantic weekend together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底哪里有毛病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it-it, What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想看点电视  有何不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanna watch a little television. What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松嘛  老妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jeez, relax, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 "放轻松  小摩"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said, "Jeez, relax, Mon."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我一直有话要告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Rachel, I-I-I've been wanting to tell you something for a while now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非说不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I really, I just have to get it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. All right. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你上次不是说我应该  不惜代价挽救婚姻吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how you told me I should do whatever it takes to fix my marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我叫你  答应艾蜜莉所有要求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I told you to give Emily whatever she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的建议不错  不过我必须告诉你她要求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And while that was good advice, you should know that what she wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是叫我永远不能再见你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is for me not to see you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太离谱了  你根本做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's crazy. You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跟她解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you gonna tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经答应了  对不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you've already agreed to this, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道自己很糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's awful, I know. Uh, it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我心情也很糟糕  但这是挽救婚姻的唯一方法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I feel terrible, but I have to do this if I want my marriage to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很希望跟她合好  必须挽救这段婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I do. I have to make this marriage work. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好在她来之前  我们还能继续见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the good thing is, we can still see each other until she gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, lucky me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  这真是好消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! That is good news, Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从拉普过世之后  最大的好消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's the best news I've heard since LaPooh died!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我有多难过  我也很痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have no idea what a nightmare this has been. Uh, this is so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  真的吗  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, really? Is it, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为你减轻压力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let me make this a little easier for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么  愤而出走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Storming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  这是你家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, this is your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我有多生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Well, that's how mad I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,臭巧克力糖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn Rolos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you're back. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.99,0:11:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次出差如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How was your conference?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟透了  我跟同事吵架  到回来前都没合好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was terrible. I fought with my colleagues for the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你整个周末都泡汤了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, so your weekend was a total bust?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不会  我看到  唐纳川普等电梯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, I got to see Donald Trump waiting for an elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你也回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey, you're back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  钱德  可以出来一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Um, Chandler, could I talk to you outside for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烹饪大会好玩吗  糟透了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How was your chef thing? Ugh. It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人根本不会欣赏美食\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess some people don't appreciate really good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的美食可能看起来很美味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe it was the kind of food that tasted good at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃下去却害人上吐下泻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but then made everybody vomit and have diarrhea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旅馆费用多少  我要付我那一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'd like to know how much the room was because I'd like to pay my half.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  三百元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine. $300.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三百元  就想成每间二十五元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three hundred dollars? Yeah. Just think of it as $25 per room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们鬼叫什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you guys woofing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德从我皮包偷了二十元纸钞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler stole a 20 from my purse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  我现在回头想想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪我老是没有二十元的   原来你倒有很多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I constantly find myself without 20s, and you always have lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该看看她当时的表情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should've seen the look on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:13:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望瑞秋恨我  真不知道该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want Rachel to hate me. I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要听我的建议吗   请说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want my advice? Yes. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听了一定不高兴  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not gonna like it. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你决定结婚太匆促了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got married too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算哪门子忠告  看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not advice. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去洗手间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是有人叫我别见你们其中一个  我绝对办不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, if anyone asked me to give up any of you, I don't think I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们听说  罗斯跟我的事情了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know you guys heard about the whole thing with me and Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经烦了一整天  请你们别再提起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I've been obsessing about it all day and would love not to talk about it.All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这算不算提起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I don't know if this falls under that category...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过罗斯就在后面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, uh, Ross is right back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是罗斯  不是那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not Ross. Oh, no, not that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然他很像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He does look like him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯去洗手间了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Ross is in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  开始了  现在就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. It's happening. It's already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就像阿吉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Kip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.29,0:14:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你才不是阿吉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah, you're not Kip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道阿吉是谁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you even know who Kip is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁管他  你是瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who cares? You're Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿吉是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's Kip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前的室友  以前也跟大家很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kip, my old roommate. We all hung out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个可怜人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧  你们跟我说过那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? You told me the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以前跟摩妮卡约会  分手后却无法共处一室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He and Monica dated when they broke up they couldn't even be in the same room together
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都答应继续跟他做朋友  结果呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You all promised you'd stay his friend.And what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不是从此遭到排挤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He got phased out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才不会排挤你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not gonna be phased out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会  罗斯一定可以留下来  因为他是你哥哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, of course I am.It won't happen to Ross. He's your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他又是你大学室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}your old college roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迟早有人会离开这个小圈子  我以前还以为走的是菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a matter of time before someone had to leave the group. I just always assumed Phoebe would be the one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你住得远  又不是谁的亲戚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, come on, you live far away, you're not related.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快就会被淡忘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You lift right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Mr. Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你住的饭店打电话来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That, uh, hotel you stayed at called.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说在你房间捡到睫毛夹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Said someone left an eyelash curler in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, that was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你钓上哪个马子  她忘了带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figured you hooked up with some girl and she left it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种说法的确比较合理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, that would have made more sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都快要不认识你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I don't even feel like I know you anymore, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只问你一次就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, uh, look, I'm just gonna ask you this one time, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你怎么说  我都相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And whatever you say, I'll believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是去参加同性恋大会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were you or were you no on a gay cruise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该说大家都会淡忘你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry about the whole lifting-out thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得跟着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪里  跟着我就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come where? Wherever I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  我们可以重组一个团体  毕竟我跟你才是精华\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, you and me, we'll start a new group. We're the best ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不过记得拉乔伊入伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but try to get Joey too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我可以跟瑞秋私下谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, do you mind if I speak to Rachel alone for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是违反规定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't this against the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟摩妮卡谈过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I talked to Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我做这个选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm the one who made the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我害的大家必须要改变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the one who's making things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以离开的应该是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I should be the one to, you know, step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  真的没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Ross... No, no, it's okay. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:17:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人只有在感恩节见到妹妹  同学会才见到大学室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plenty of people just see their sisters at Thanksgiving,and just see their college roommates at reunions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在 "汉堡王" 才见到乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and just see Joey at Burger King.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你舒服一点了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So is, is that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's not better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是见不到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still don't get to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  换做你会怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what would you do, Rach? If you were me, what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  我在婚礼上  不会说错名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for starters, I would have said the right name at my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然会是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  抱歉打扰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Hey, Rach? Sorry to interrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比说你要告诉我  谈谈旅行什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but, uh, Phoebe said you wanted to talk to me about a trip or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just came over to drop off...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上周末过得很糟吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that weekend kind of sucked, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那大概我们完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I guess this is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我说你跟我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Well, you know, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正迟早得结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it had to end sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为上周末  我们吵架啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because of the weekend. We had a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  别傻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你每次吵架就分手  交往大概不会超过...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you give up every time you have a fight with someone,you'd never be with anyone longer than...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还可以继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}this isn't over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我们只是吵架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. It was a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吵过之后就算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You deal with it and you move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没什么好害怕的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's nothing to freak out about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入成熟恋人行列\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Welcome to an adult relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还算是恋爱男女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're in a relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm afraid so. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  听说你上周  看到唐纳川普\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, Monica, I heard you saw Donald Trump at your convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我看到他在等电梯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, saw him waiting for an elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  借我睫毛夹  我的丢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, can I borrow your eyelash curler? I think I lost mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  在厕所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  过来一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  跟你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You? And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是你不能告诉别人  还没有人知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but you cannot tell anyone. No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会  何时的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But how? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要从伦敦说起  伦敦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It happened in London. In London!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们之所以没告诉大家  是不想你们大惊小怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The reason we didn't tell anyone was we didn't wanna make a big deal out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.90,0:20:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这的确是大事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非告诉谁不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to tell someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你不能说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你  我们就是  不想面对大家质问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please? Please?! We just don't want to deal with telling everyone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  保证不说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, just promise you won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:20:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, this is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是件好事啊  可是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's great! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  的确很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想看到这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't wanna see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真是太蠢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们在做什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know what's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想抢走乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're trying to take Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,网球界最有名的菲比  就叫做杀球菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"The most popular Phoebe in tennis is called the overhand Phoebe. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赢了就得跟对方击掌  说 "嗨  菲比"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you win, you must slap your opponent on the Phoebe and say, 'Hi, Phoebe!"'
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思  很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's cute. We really all enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.05,0:21:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这不算  不算什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know it doesn't count. Count for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不算疯狂字谜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just count in our heads as good Mad Libs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想玩了  不好玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess fun time's over. Yeah, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  要遵守规则才有意思  也才有意义啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, guys, if we follow the rules,it's still fun and it means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要闪人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:22:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有规则才好  不守规则怎么会好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys, rules are good!Rules help control the fun.
